    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know what people say about \"carrying on,\" but it just feels so selfish. like, i'm just dragging them down with my mess. wouldn't it be more peaceful for everyone if the disappointment just ended? i just keep thinking about how much cleaner everything would be if i could just erase the part where i failed. it's like the only way to actually fix the honor of the family is to let the mistake die with me. does that even make sense?",
